n style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"phase\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dormancy_or_strike_off\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"items\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"task\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"final_tax_return\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"owner\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tax\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"evidence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tax-clearance-certificate.pdf\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"task\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"settle_intercompany_balances\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"owner\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"treasury\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"task\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"release_guarantees\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"owner\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"legal\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"task\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"close_bank_accounts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"owner\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"treasury\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"evidence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"account-closure-letter.pdf\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"task\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"archive_records\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"owner\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"finance\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"retention_years\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>blocking</code> 标记是最有价值的一个字段：它把&quot;实体可运营&quot;从主观判断变成有明确条件的门。建议至少把银行开户完成与税务登记完成标为阻塞项。</p>\n<h2 id=\"休眠实体的处理\">休眠实体的处理</h2><p>并非所有不再使用的实体都需要立即注销。注销的成本与周期在部分辖区相当高（尤其涉及税务清算证明时），因此把实体转为休眠是一个常见折中。休眠状态要求依然存在：多数辖区要求休眠实体继续提交申报（即使是零申报），并继续满足其适用的实质或申报义务。休眠实体不是不用管的实体——一个被遗忘的休眠实体在多年后可能因未申报而被除名，而其名下的资产或合同关系需要相应处理。</p>\n<p>当休眠实体不再有任何持有价值时，注销应尽早启动，因为注销流程本身可能耗时数月。判断依据很简单：它是否还持有资产、是否还承担担保或合同义务、是否为某条关联交易链条的当事人。三项皆无即为可以注销。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>设立需要六类事项全部完成才算可运营，其中银行开户周期最容易被低估，应设为阻塞项。</li>\n<li>设立顺序与关联交易顺序倒置会导致已发生交易没有合法主体承接，应在设立阶段预留过渡安排。</li>\n<li>股权、董事与地址、经营范围三类变更各自带有税务居民身份、实质判定或功能定位的连带影响，不能只做登记更新。</li>\n<li>注销的核心是&quot;先清理再终止&quot;，检查项覆盖税务清算、资产负债处置、合同担保、银行账户与记录保存。</li>\n<li>休眠是有成本的中间状态，仍须按辖区要求持续申报；当实体不再持有资产、担保或合同义务时应尽早启动注销。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>延伸阅读（本 hub 内）</strong>：<a href=\"multi-entity-governance-control\">多实体治理与受控管理</a> 讲授权与印章控制；<a href=\"entity-substance-review\">经济实质年度审查</a> 讲实质达标如何按年核对；<a href=\"../entity-footprint-design/economic-substance-setup\">经济实质与实体设立要求</a> 讲设立时的实质门槛。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"实体设立/变更/注销","id":"实体设立-变更-注销"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：设立的可运营条件","id":"核心概念-设立的可运营条件"},{"level":2,"text":"变更：三类高频变更与它们的连带影响","id":"变更-三类高频变更与它们的连带影响"},{"level":3,"text":"股权变更","id":"股权变更"},{"level":3,"text":"董事与注册地址变更","id":"董事与注册地址变更"},{"level":3,"text":"经营范围与功能变更","id":"经营范围与功能变更"},{"level":2,"text":"注销：先清理再终止","id":"注销-先清理再终止"},{"level":2,"text":"休眠实体的处理","id":"休眠实体的处理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"区域结算/利润布局合规","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-entity-trade-structure/pe-tp-entity-link/regional-settlement-profit"},"next":{"title":"多实体治理与受控管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-entity-trade-structure/entity-structure-ops/multi-entity-governance-control"}}